#: ../../content/medicaments/index.md:71
msgid "Boxes to order, orders, the pharmacy's deliveries, residents without a mandate; **Prepare the Orders**, **All the Orders**, **Pharmacy Mandates**, **Pharmacy's Deliveries**."
